---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
const team = [{ name: "Nicholas 'Eagle' Kendra", focus: 'Network & IT Services', bio: 'Bio to be added.' }, ...Array.from({length:4}, () => ({ name: 'Team member', focus: 'Focus area', bio: 'Name, focus area and bio to be added.' }))];
---
<Layout title="About our student-led team" description="Meet Marist Tech Clinic, a student-led team at Marist University’s Technology Research & Innovation Center serving Hudson Valley organizations." page="/about/">
  <div class="container"><header class="page-intro"><p class="page-kicker">About the clinic</p><h1>Learning by doing.<br />Helping close to home.</h1><p class="lead">We’re a student-led team at Marist University, part of the Marist Technology Research & Innovation Center, serving organizations across the Hudson Valley.</p></header>
    <div class="about-story"><section><h2>Who we are</h2><p>Marist students bring their interests in networks, security, software, data and AI to practical work for local organizations. We’re organized by specialty, with faculty support.</p><p>We listen first, explain our recommendations in plain English, and agree on the scope in writing before work begins.</p></section><section><h2>Why we do it</h2><p>Students get real-world experience. Local organizations get real technology help they might not otherwise afford.</p><p>Our goal is a useful exchange: hands-on learning for us, clearer decisions and practical next steps for you.</p></section></div>
  </div>
  <section class="section section-neutral"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>A clear scope. Honest expectations.</h2><p>We want you to know exactly where we can help.</p></div></div><div class="scope-grid"><section class="scope-block"><h3>What we do</h3><ul><li>Technology and security assessments</li><li>Training and awareness</li><li>Planning and recommendations</li><li>One-time projects</li><li>Referrals</li></ul></section><section class="scope-block"><h3>What we don’t do</h3><ul><li>24/7 emergency support</li><li>Ongoing managed IT contracts</li></ul><p class="small">For urgent or ongoing needs, we’ll point you to trusted local providers.</p></section></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>The people behind the clinic.</h2><p>Team profiles will be completed as details and photos are supplied.</p></div></div><div class="team-grid">{team.map(member => <article class="team-card"><div class="portrait-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Team photo not yet supplied">Photo to be added</div><div class="team-copy"><h3>{member.name}</h3><p class="team-focus">{member.focus}</p><p class="team-bio">{member.bio}</p></div></article>)}</div></section>
  <CTA />
</Layout>
